From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:22:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wizard: AD5X setup steps (self-check, PID, mesh, shaper, IFS,
 Z offset, save)

One data-driven wizard step, instantiated for the seven AD5X tuning steps.
Each drives Klipper's ad5x_setup steps through the API endpoint
printer.ad5x_setup.control (G-code SETUP_WIZARD_STEP as fallback) and shows
the ad5x_setup status object (subscribed when Klipper has it). The steps
appear only with the ad5x preset or an ad5x_setup object; they sit before
the built-in input shaper step, which the preset keeps skipped. The
telemetry opt-in step is skipped on these printers.

Upstream: not applicable (AD5X OS specific)
